<h2 id="removal">Corrections and removal</h2>
<p>If you wrote something here and want it removed or corrected, or if anything
appears that should not be public, open a request. You do not need to explain
why, and there is no process to work through. If the matter is not one you want
to raise in public, open the form and say only that, and a private channel will
be arranged.</p>

